{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Divine Premise &amp; Celestial Stakes</strong><br>Step into the boots of a bold pilgrim who\u2019s dared to breach the boundaries between mortal coil and the 3rd Heaven. In Its Time To Meet God, you are thrown into interdimensional rifts conjured by demi\u2011gods, eldritch horrors and angelic sentinels alike. Your mission? Survive these unholy realms, unravel the mysteries woven into each plane, and ascend to the ultimate confrontation in the Peace and Tranquility of the Third Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Ruthless Ray casting Combat &amp; Tactical Loot</strong> <br>Arm yourself with an infinite stock of razor\u2011sharp throwing knives before you discover the heavier firepower of shotguns, pistols, and dual\u2010wielded handguns. Every strike demands precision\u2014every reload could mean life or death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Psychedelic Realms &amp; Ever\u2011Shifting Replay ability</strong> <br>Every run catapults you into captivating procedurally generated dreamscapes drenched in mind\u2011bending color palettes and neon lighting effects. No two journeys look or play the same: Items don\u2019t carry across runs, so every expedition is a fresh test of your reflexes and strategy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545880?t=1760442291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545880?t=1760442291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545880/8f2e59d88a3a9111663148665c123d35e7780cb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760442291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545880/8f2e59d88a3a9111663148665c123d35e7780cb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760442291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains scenes of Violence and Gore."},"demos":[{"appid":3947020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Demo Release</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After some time and a long amount of waiting I am pleased to announce the &quot;Its Time To Meet God&quot; Demo is live and ready to be played.\u00a0<br><br>- Feel free to leave a review and tell me what needs to be changed<br>- If you liked the game, please give it a wishlist!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Divine Premise &amp; Celestial Stakes</strong><br>Step into the boots of a bold pilgrim who\u2019s dared to breach the boundaries between mortal coil and the 3rd Heaven. In Its Time To Meet God, you are thrown into interdimensional rifts conjured by demi\u2011gods, eldritch horrors and angelic sentinels alike. Your mission? Survive these unholy realms, unravel the mysteries woven into each plane, and ascend to the ultimate confrontation in the Peace and Tranquility of the Third Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Ruthless Ray casting Combat &amp; Tactical Loot</strong> <br>Arm yourself with an infinite stock of razor\u2011sharp throwing knives before you discover the heavier firepower of shotguns, pistols, and dual\u2010wielded handguns. Every strike demands precision\u2014every reload could mean life or death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Psychedelic Realms &amp; Ever\u2011Shifting Replay ability</strong> <br>Every run catapults you into captivating procedurally generated dreamscapes drenched in mind\u2011bending color palettes and neon lighting effects. No two journeys look or play the same: Items don\u2019t carry across runs, so every expedition is a fresh test of your reflexes and strategy.</p>","developers":["Kruix"],"drm_notice":"None<br>None machine activataion limit machine activation limit","ext_user_account_notice":"none ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"